Kelvin (K) to Celsius(C):

C = K - 273.15

Celsius (C) to Fahrenheit (F):

F = (95 x C) + 32

Psyche’s temperature ranges could possibly range from 150 K to 500 K depending on the current exposure to the sun. 
Earth’s surface ranges from 200 K to 310 K depending on the environment.

To find the extremes of Psyche’s temperature, we will convert both 150 K and 500 K, as well as 200 K and 310 K to Celsius and Fahrenheit.

Psyche temperature conversions:

150 K to Celsius: 
		
		C = 150 - 273.15 = -123.15° C

150 K to Fahrenheit: 

F = (95 x -123.15) + 32 = -189.67° F

500 K to Celsius:

C = 500 - 273.15 = 266.85℃

500 K to Fahrenheit:

F = (95 x 226.85) + 32 = 440.33℉

Earth temperature conversions:

200 K to Celsius:

		C = 200 - 273.15 = -73.15℃

200 K to Fahrenheit:

		F = (95 x -73.15) + 32 = -99.67℉

310 K to Celsius:

		C = 310 - 273.15  = 36.85℃

310 K to Fahrenheit:

		F = (95 x 36.85) + 32 = 98.33℉
